content
first =~ built                           true
first !~ second                          true
first < second                           true
second > first                           true
first <> second                          -15

identity
first == built                           false
first == first                           true

case
shouting =~ first                        false
shouting.to_lower() =~ first.to_lower()  true
string.compare(shouting, first, ignore_case) 0

numeric strings compare as text
"10" < "9"                               true
10 < 9                                   false
